<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Inner Light Journal — a space for mindfulness, meditation, and spirituality."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-04-07')}
>
	<p>
		Welcome to Inner Light Journal. This blog is a dedicated space for exploring the
		practices and philosophies that help us live more consciously — mindfulness,
		meditation, and spirituality.
	</p>

	<p>
		Whether you are just beginning your journey inward or have been practicing for years,
		you will find thoughtful articles, guided practices, and reflections to support your path.
	</p>

	<p>
		Our content spans several areas:
	</p>

	<ul>
		<li><strong>Mindfulness</strong> — Cultivating present-moment awareness in daily life</li>
		<li><strong>Meditation</strong> — Techniques, traditions, and practical guidance</li>
		<li><strong>Spirituality</strong> — Exploring meaning, connection, and inner wisdom</li>
		<li><strong>Wellness</strong> — The intersection of mind, body, and spirit</li>
		<li><strong>Practice</strong> — Concrete exercises and routines you can try today</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		We believe that a more peaceful world begins with the individual. Each moment of
		awareness, each breath taken with intention, contributes to a more compassionate
		and conscious life.
	</p>
